---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import Image from "../components/EditorialImage.astro";
import UpdatesBand from "../components/UpdatesBand.astro";
const values = [
  [
    "Kindness",
    "We make clothes for good people. Kind to the people who wear them, the people who make them, and the people they are given to.",
  ],
  [
    "Community",
    "A brand is the people wearing it. Friends, families, the person you love and the ones you look after. There is room for all of them here.",
  ],
  [
    "The life you build",
    "Work matters. So does what happens after: the small wins, the time together, the ideas you keep coming back to.",
  ],
];
---

<Site
  title="The story"
  description="The After Hours Agenda story, from the original 2012 Prologue to a clothing brand built around kindness, community and the life you are building."
>
  <header class="page-head shell">
    <p class="label">After Hours Agenda · Est. 2011</p>
    <h1>
      THE TIME
      <br />
      THAT IS <span class="accent">YOURS.</span>
    </h1>
  </header>
  <section class="about-intro shell">
    <div>
      <p class="lede">
        After hours is the part of the day you give to the people and the ideas
        you love, after the work is done.
      </p>
      <p>
        In January 2012, the first site opened with a typed page called The
        Prologue. “We are dreamers,” it said. “We create, and we build.” That is
        the thread running through the brand.
      </p>
      <p>
        Graphic tees, heavyweight hoods and crewnecks have carried that story.
        The black sheep is our signature: your own way of doing things, with
        good people beside you.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today, new orders are paused while the next collection is developed. The
        lookbook preserves campaign concepts and past pieces. Existing orders
        still have a direct support path.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/lookbook/">
          See the lookbook ↗
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">
          Get in touch →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure>
      <Image
        name="2012-the-prologue"
        alt="The typed January 2012 Prologue from the After Hours Agenda archive."
        priority
      />
      <figcaption class="image-caption">
        The actual 2012 Prologue · Brand archive
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <section class="shell section" aria-label="What matters to us">
    {values.map(([title, text], index) => (
      <div class="values">
        <span class="label">0{index + 1}</span>
        <h2>{title}</h2>
        <p>{text}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </section>
  <UpdatesBand />
</Site>
